<section class="reading"><h2>All 41 stations</h2><p>These are independent observations at one-foot intervals from −20 to +20 feet. No cumulative visit history is asserted. A visible sample is not a visible whole chest.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Station (ft)</th><th>A / wall sample</th><th>B / pillar sample</th></tr></thead><tbody>${E(r).map(e=>`<tr><td>${e.station}</td>${e.rays.map(e=>`<td>${n(O(e))}</td>`).join(``)}</tr>`).join(``)}</tbody></table></div></section>
